ugh verification of decisions #40–43 in a real browser during real market hours (four rounds deep without one now), then the still-open lower-priority `SymbolNotFoundError` misclassification (#43), then continuing the backend Feature Engine — Participation and the two new Context providers (decisions #19–20) — and, separately, revisiting the Timescale question against real backtesting requirements in Phase 4/5. Manual trading, Execution Mode, the Input Layer, and the hotkey/action model (decisions #22–27) are gated on Phase 5/6 — Governor, Trade Planning Engine, and Execution Engine don't exist yet — and land alongside that work, not before it.
